@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam maxMessageSize 235
skinparam DefaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #555555
    ArrowFontName SansSerif
    ArrowFontSize 14
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ParticipantBorderColor transparent
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #34495E
    ParticipantFontName SansSerif
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontColor white
    BoxBorderColor transparent
    BoxFontName SansSerif
    BoxFontSize 11
    BoxFontColor #6F8592
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontName SansSerif
    FontSize 12
    FontColor #424242
}

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

title JobSet train: from Pod event to metrics

participant "Kubernetes\nAPI + watches" as K #4263EB
box "Exporter - one process" #F4F7FA
participant "Controller\nqueue + verification" as C
participant "Discovery\nowner traversal" as D
participant "Inventory +\nKarta library" as L
participant "Published records\n+ OTel adapter" as P
end box

note over K,P #FFF9DB
Illustrative execution of the local PoC, not a live-cluster trace.
The catalog JobSet Karta supplies component, instance and replica selectors.
end note

== A. Observe a Pod before its parent ==
K -[#4263EB]> C : Pod workers-2-0 observed
C -> D : Upsert Pod\nResolve(Pod)
D --> C : ErrPending\nno usable root
C -> K : Ensure Job / owner watch coverage
note over C,D #FFF9DB
The call ends. The queue retries after a dependency changes.
No guessed root is published.
end note

== B. Accept parents, then retry ==
K -[#4263EB]> C : Job workers-2 + JobSet train observed
C -> D : Upsert parents\naccept watch sync
D --> C : Affected Pod key
C -> D : Resolve(Pod) again
D -> D : Resolve owners\nPod -> Job -> JobSet
D -> L : Select root definition
L --> D : Selection + origin
D --> C : JobSet train + optional\nKartaWorkload

== C. Interpret and verify the candidate ==
C -> D : KartaWorkload:\nPodMapping + Status
D -> L : Evaluate captured definition
L --> D : component: replicatedjob\ninstance: workers\ngroup: 2
D --> C : Mapping + status
C -> C : Run separate submitter CEL\non root + member Pods
C -> C : Prepare candidate identity\nfrom root + Pod values
C -> K : Fresh paginated LISTs:\nverify UID/RV + all Pod membership
K --> C : Matching objects + complete membership
C -> C : Recheck inputs + scope\nand accept submitter agreement
note over C,P #FFF9DB
Accept only if the candidate still matches those inputs.
Otherwise retry. Do not publish a mixed candidate.
end note
C -[#0CA678]> P : Atomic accept: records\n+ evidence

== D. Collect the accepted view ==
P -[#0CA678]> P : Collect snapshot\napply expiry\nemit gauges
note over K,P #E6FCF5
Metric collection performs no API reads, owner walks, JQ, or CEL.
The configured reader serves Prometheus or exports to an OTLP receiver.
end note
legend bottom
|<#E7F0FF> Blue | observed Kubernetes events |
| Gray | calls and returned results |
|<#E6FCF5> Green | accepted state and metric collection |
endlegend
@enduml
